# Force LF for the generated FPGA hardware data files.
#
# The export writes LF-only files and records their SHA256 in manifest.json /
# checksums.sha256.  With core.autocrlf=true git would convert them to CRLF on
# a Windows checkout, changing the bytes and breaking the recorded hashes.
# eol=lf pins both the blob and the working tree to LF so the hashes are stable
# across machines and checkouts.
fpga/baseline_cnn/**  text eol=lf
